# Git Merge Workflow

- **NEVER merge to `main`.** Do not merge feature or fix branches into `main`, and do not push merge commits to `origin/main`.
- **Imperative Konva migration branch policy:** feature and fix branches for this migration merge into `spike/react-konva-1`.
- **Final promotion only:** after migration waves are complete, merge `spike/react-konva-1` into `development`.
- When asked to "merge" or "push and merge" for Imperative Konva migration work, merge the current branch into `spike/react-konva-1`; do not touch `main`.
